$2 {A} + \\dfrac{1}{2} {B}$, where\n$\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$ and ${B}=\n    \\left\\lbrack\n    \\matrix {\n        0 & 2 \\\n        4 & 2\n    }\n    \\right\\rbrack\n.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of $A$ by $2$ and each entry of $B$ by $\\dfrac{1}{2},$ and then add the resulting matrices, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2A+\\frac{1}{2}B & =2\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\cdot 1 & 2\\cdot 5 \\\\ 2\\cdot 1 & 2\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 0 & \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4 & \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 10 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2+0 & 10+1 \\\\ 2+2 & 4+1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 11 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a6727fdd-a614-5ead-9273-08c0a7fec997" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050127 :topic/math-academy-id 64 :topic/title "Evaluating Linear Expressions"}] :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059997 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d11ade1a-b8aa-5a3b-a93b-0c972ee05e30" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 8 \\\\ 8 & -8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056341} {:answer/id #uuid "d54a67c4-5025-5e41-8e4c-da1a85a87afd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & -8 \\\\ -8 & 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056342} {:answer/id #uuid "053084de-6256-5a3f-b19b-bba7f9d6cea9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 8 \\\\ 8 & 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056343} {:answer/id #uuid "2bc35dad-d013-5ee1-a4cb-cd790a8ccbb4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}8 & -