51f1e0c08b3" :question/math-academy-id "q-11536" :question/problem "Calculate $2P - 3Q$, where\n$P = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$Q = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233218 :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "43036e7c-a70a-56a3-8bee-031be9fe31b1" :question/math-academy-id "q-11532" :question/problem "Calculate $2H-3L$, where\n$H=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$L=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of $H$ by $2$ and each entry of $L$ by $3,$ and then subtract the resulting matrices, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2H-3L & =2\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\cdot 3 & 2\\cdot (-2) \\\\ 2\\cdot 2 & 2\\cdot (-1)\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}3\\cdot 0 & 3\\cdot 1 \\\\ 3\\cdot 2 & 3\\cdot 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6-0 & -4-3 \\\\ 4-6 & -2-3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -7 \\\\ -2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250392 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01083aba-7159-5668-975e-80fd900b5e13" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 9 \\\\ -4 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247420} {:answer/id #uuid "25a32a75-2be4-5aa0-b7ac-0758260d6b2d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -9 \\\\ -4 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247757} {:answer/id #uuid "67ac8976-5d43-5318-81df-5210173a511d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 9 \\\\ 9 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248354} {:answer/id #uuid "d50f4c89-9a1c-5ecd-b1ad-84d3afaca026" :answer/typ